{
  "timeline": [
    {
      "speaker": "Peter",
      "text": "One slow service is annoying, not fatal, right?",
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "end_s": 2.616
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Stewie",
      "text": "It is fatal if it cascades. Stability patterns stop the spread.",
      "start_s": 2.766,
      "end_s": 6.606
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Peter",
      "text": "What's a circuit breaker?",
      "start_s": 6.756,
      "end_s": 8.316
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Stewie",
      "text": "When a dependency fails enough, it trips open and calls fail fast instead of hanging.",
      "start_s": 8.466,
      "end_s": 12.33
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Peter",
      "text": "Then what?",
      "start_s": 12.48,
      "end_s": 13.632
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Stewie",
      "text": "It half-opens to test recovery. Succeed and it closes again.",
      "start_s": 13.782,
      "end_s": 17.502
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Peter",
      "text": "Timeouts?",
      "start_s": 17.652,
      "end_s": 18.828
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Stewie",
      "text": "Bound how long a call waits. No infinite hangs.",
      "start_s": 18.978,
      "end_s": 22.338
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Peter",
      "text": "Retries?",
      "start_s": 22.488,
      "end_s": 24.264
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Stewie",
      "text": "Fine with backoff, but cap them. Retry storms make outages worse.",
      "start_s": 24.414,
      "end_s": 28.662
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Peter",
      "text": "Bulkheads?",
      "start_s": 28.812,
      "end_s": 30.588
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Stewie",
      "text": "Separate resource pools per dependency. One exhausted pool can't starve the rest.",
      "start_s": 30.738,
      "end_s": 35.202
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Peter",
      "text": "What about load?",
      "start_s": 35.352,
      "end_s": 37.128
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Stewie",
      "text": "Throttling and rate limiting shed excess and keep a steady pace.",
      "start_s": 37.278,
      "end_s": 40.302
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Peter",
      "text": "So failures stay contained?",
      "start_s": 40.452,
      "end_s": 42.252
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Stewie",
      "text": "Exactly. Degraded but alive beats fully down.",
      "start_s": 42.402,
      "end_s": 45.738
    }
  ],
